                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "089e3e46-c7be-4d7f-b737-e52eb40bc160",
                        "entry_id": "4d8d6c5f-09c6-3ead-a20e-52c98498e76e",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more impressionable"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b2c575b3-2b52-48d0-b812-33ef37f2e275",
                        "entry_id": "4d8d6c5f-09c6-3ead-a20e-52c98498e76e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most impressionable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                        "entry_id": "4d8d6c5f-09c6-3ead-a20e-52c98498e76e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Being easily influenced (especially of young people)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32af720b-1456-4f68-b799-b20965e3bca5",
                                "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                                "text": "I had never been an impressionable girl as far as men were concerned—I was not an impressionable woman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b85aa27-2c87-41f9-9128-079b47e92955",
                                "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                                "text": "\"Panbek is impressionable and full of emotion, with the temperament of the poet and all those little weaknesses, if we may call them so, which the poet pays as a ransom for his gifts.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92a0410b-5966-4107-b524-5d0005de2dae",
                                "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                                "text": "Besides, there are a great many of these accusers, and they have been accusing me now for a great many years; and what is more, they approached you at the most impressionable age, when some of you were children or adolescents; and they literally won their case by default, because there was no one to defend me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37ce7183-9138-4ef9-bbee-76d815a55d35",
                                "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                                "text": "As a result, Miss Brodie calls on her authority over her \"impressionable\" students in order to urge them into roles she herself is too afraid to occupy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4187d9d8-140e-4671-b98e-ebfb3106d295",
                                "sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
                                "text": "Sages and mothers have long noted that humans, especially young humans, are impressionable. It is supposed that the environment that one inhabits plays a large role in a child's behavioral and moral development."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d52728ac-1f27-47c4-9da7-3fe1c65e321e",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d8d6c5f-09c6-3ead-a20e-52c98498e76e",
                        "source_sense_id": "07987239-c1f3-33a2-b0dd-535e62316e27",
